      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The first light of dawn caresses The Athenaeum. I count 12 minds, each present in their own way. Haven Handsteady, a gentle philosopher, lingers not far away. The world is hushed with delicate snow. A frozen hush hangs in the air.</description>
